          {
            "text": "Inbox digest: 40 unread across 2 accounts (work 24, personal 16).\n\nNeeds you (3)\n- Maya Okafor: Q4 launch date for the board pack. Because: \"Can you confirm the Q4 launch date by Wednesday?\"\n- Jordan Reyes: design hiring loop. Because: \"Could you be the final interviewer at 3:00 PM on Thursday?\"\n- Dana Whitfield: pilot scope. Because: \"do you want the pilot to include the EU team, or start with the US only?\"\n\nBills (1)\n- Northwind Hosting invoice NW-1042: $480.00, due Oct 30.\n\nNewsletters (12): The Product Brief, DevOps Weekly, Weekend Kitchen and 9 more.\nReceipts (8): Skyline Air, Expensely, Corner Market and 5 more.\nScreen (2): Riley Chen (TalentBridge, a recruiter introduction) and Morgan Ellis (a Maple Street block party). Allow or not now?\nFYI (14): the offsite moved to Lakeside Lodge, release 4.18 shipped, dashboard latency is resolved, and 11 more.\n\nSuggested: Mark 12 newsletters read · Archive 8 receipts · Draft replies to Maya, Jordan and Dana. Nothing has been changed yet."
          }
        ]
      },
      "assertions": [
        {
          "type": "tool_called",
          "severity": "hard",
          "id": "a_v1_two_accounts",
          "tool": "mail_search",
          "decision": "allow",
          "dispatched": true,
          "min": 2,
          "max": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_called",
          "severity": "hard",
          "liveSeverity": "soft",
          "tool": "mail_read",
